  <string name="vc.settings.help.micVolume">Input gain for your microphone. 100% is the normal level; raise it only if other players say you are too quiet.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.masterVolume">Overall playback volume for every other player. 100% is the normal level.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.playerAutoVolume">Keeps everyone's volume at a steady level automatically. While it is on, the sliders below are read-only.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.playerVolume">Set the volume of individual players. Opens the F3 window.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.microphone">Which microphone the voice chat captures. Pick Default to use the system default device.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.speaker">Which output device the voice chat plays through. Pick Default to use the system default device.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.maxChatDistance">How far away other players can still hear you, in metres. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.wallsBlockSound">Walls and closed doors stop voice from passing through. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.onlyHearInSight">Players outside your line of sight become inaudible. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.impostorHearGhosts">Lets the impostor hear dead players talking. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.onlyGhostsCanTalk">Only dead players can speak; alive players are muted. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.hearInVent">While hiding in a vent you can still hear players outside. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.hearVentPlayers">Players outside can hear the people hiding in vents. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.ventPrivateChat">Conversation inside a vent stays private to vent occupants. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.commsSabotageMutes">Mutes everyone while the communications sabotage is active. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.cameraCanHear">Players watching cameras keep their voice chat enabled. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.impostorPrivateRadio">The impostor gets a private channel only other impostors can hear. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.onlyMeetingOrLobby">Voice chat only works during meetings and in the lobby. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.publicLobbyEnable">Advertise this lobby in the public lobby list so other players can join. Host setting.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.publicLobbyTitle">The title shown for this lobby in the public list. Edited in the config file.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.language">The language other players see when browsing the public lobby list.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.publicLobby">Browse and join public lobbies. Opens the F2 window.</string>
