  <string name="vc.hud.natfix">TURN relay (NAT fix)</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.natFix">Sends all voice through a relay server from the start instead of trying a direct connection between players. Only turn it on if you keep failing to hear each other — the trade-off is a little extra delay for everyone in the room.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.turnRegion">Which relay server region to use. Auto always picks the one that answers fastest; pick a specific region only if you want to force it. Most players should leave this on Auto.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.url">Custom voice server address, used when the last (Custom) entry is selected. Edited in the config file.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.refresh">Restarts the voice connection for the current game using the selected server.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.noiseSuppression">Removes constant background noise such as fans and keyboard clicks.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.echoCancellation">Reduces feedback when you play through speakers instead of headphones.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.vad">Voice activity detection: only sends audio while you are actually speaking.</string>
