  <string name="vc.settings.testPlaying">Playing</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.transport">How your voice reaches other players. Auto sends direct P2P and falls back to the server relay per peer when no direct path opens. P2P is direct only: peers you cannot reach directly hear nothing. Relay sends everything through the voice server (the original scheme). Changing it reconnects the voice room.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.micLevel">Live microphone level. Speak: the bar should jump. If it never moves, the wrong input device is selected or the mic is muted elsewhere.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.micTest">Opens the selected microphone so you can watch the level bar while you speak.</string>
  <string name="vc.settings.help.speakerTest">Plays a short test chime through the selected output device.</string>
